        "explanationEn": "The correct Sanskrit word is «मांसम्».\nFull Verse:\nमत्वाऽपि यज्ञशेषं च वाऽपि देवनिवेदितम्।\nमांसं कदापि भक्ष्यं न सत्सङ्गमाश्रितैर्जनैः॥ ३७॥\nMeaning: Satsangis should never eat meat, even if it is considered to be the remnant of a yagna or sanctified by the deities. (37)",
