        "explanationEn": "The correct Sanskrit word is «पृथक्».\nFull Verse:\nस्वीयपूजा स्वतन्त्रा तु सर्वै रक्ष्या गृहे पृथक्।\nजन्मनो दिवसादेव पूजा ग्राह्या स्वसंततेः॥ ७८॥\nMeaning: Every satsangi in a household should keep their own separate puja. Moreover, one should acquire a puja for a child on the same day that he or she is born. (78)",
