        "explanationEn": "The correct Sanskrit word is «दिव्यं».\nFull Verse:\nसिद्धान्तं सुविजानीयाद् अक्षरपुरुषोत्तमम्।\nब्रह्मविद्यात्मकं दिव्यं वैदिकं च सनातनम्॥ १०१॥\nMeaning: One should know [and realize] the divine Akshar-Purushottam siddhānt , which is Vedic, eternal and the form of brahmavidyā . (101)",
