        "explanationEn": "The correct Sanskrit word is «सत्कार्याः».\nFull Verse:\nसदैवाऽऽदरणीया हि विद्वद्वरिष्ठशिक्षकाः।\nयथाशक्ति च सत्कार्याः साधुवादादिकर्मणा॥ १६०॥\nMeaning: One should always respect the learned, seniors and teachers. According to one’s capacity, one should honor them with good words and other such deeds. (160)",
