        "explanationEn": "The correct word is «અભ્યુદય».\nFull Meaning: Rulers should follow dharma that is necessary to govern well. They should provide for the people, foster their growth and safeguard sanskārs . They should suitably arrange services for health, education, defense, electricity, food, water and other resources for the benefit of all. (201–202)"
