        "explanationEn": "The correct Sanskrit word is «कर्तव्या».\nFull Verse:\nजन्ममहोत्सवा नित्यं स्वामिनारायणप्रभोः।\nब्रह्माऽक्षरगुरूणां च कर्तव्या भक्तिभावतः॥ २४५॥\nMeaning: The birth festivals of Bhagwan Swaminarayan and the Aksharbrahman gurus should always be celebrated with devotion. (245)",
