        "explanationEn": "The correct Sanskrit word is «दुःखविनाशका».\nFull Verse:\nआज्ञोपासनसिद्धान्ताः सर्वजीवहितावहाः।\nदुःखविनाशका एते परमसुखदायकाः॥ २८७॥\nMeaning: These principles of āgnā and upāsanā are beneficial to all; they destroy misery and bestow utmost bliss. (287)",
