        "explanationEn": "The correct meaning of «तत्कृपाभाजनो» is «recipient of his grace».\nShloka 289: Those who faithfully and lovingly strengthen āgnā and upāsanā in their life according to this shastra earn the pleasure of Bhagwan and become a recipient of his grace. While living, they attain the brāhmi sthiti described in the shastras. They master ekāntik dharma . They attain the eternal and divine Akshardham of Bhagwan, ultimate moksha and bliss. (288–290)"
