        "explanationEn": "The correct Sanskrit word is «कदाचन».\nFull Verse:\nआत्मघातोऽपि हिंसैव न कार्योऽतः कदाचन।\nपतनगलबन्धाद्यैर्विषभक्षादिभिस्तथा॥ ४१॥\nMeaning: Suicide is also a form of violence. Therefore, never commit suicide by falling from heights, hanging oneself, consuming poison or any other means. (41)",
