        "explanationEn": "The correct Sanskrit word is «भक्तः».\nFull Verse:\nततः पूजाऽधिकाराय भक्तः सत्सङ्गमाश्रितः।\nकुर्यादात्मविचारं च प्रतापं चिन्तयन् हरेः॥ ५६॥\nMeaning: Thereafter, to gain the privilege to perform puja, a devotee who has taken the refuge of satsang should meditate on their ātmā while contemplating upon the glory of Bhagwan. The sacred mantra ‘Aksharam-aham Purushottam-dāso’smi’ should be recited with joy and devotion. One should identify one’s ātmā with Aksharbrahman and perform mānsi puja with a calm and focused mind. (56–58)",
